{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101157","id":2260791773,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6GwPHd","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101157","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101157.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101157.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101157","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101157/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101157/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101157/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f26be323f6c17769b9a049a277c58ef43890a4fd","number":101157,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix error when connecting signal to non-tool script deferred","user":{"login":"LanzaSchneider","id":24624901,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NjI0OTAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24624901?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider","html_url":"https://github.com/LanzaSchneider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"We'll start by creating a new scene and attaching a non-tool script, then connect the `ready` signal to this script's method as shown here, and check the `deferred` option:\r\n![Godot_v4 4-dev6_win64_2Q9oRKYIEt](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f9b8864a-cdf1-481a-ad12-f77d18009f61)\r\n\r\nSave & close this scene, reopen it and we get a error message:\r\n![Godot_v4 4-dev6_win64_qT66E40PkG](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/37c8fd30-f504-4a25-994c-14d525cb86be)\r\n\r\n**Cause analysis:**\r\nIn previous implementations, only signals that did not have `deferred` enabled were checked to ensure that non-toolscript method calls were not triggered in the `editor_hint` state.\r\n\r\nBy this PR, the timing of this check has been moved forward so that non-toolscript method calls can be avoided even in `deferred` enabled signal connections.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16